  \[Tau]Dyad\[Dagger][] - 12*PsiCDe1Dyad[]*\[Kappa]pDyad[]*\[Tau]pDyad[] + 
 6*PsiCDe4Dyad[]*\[Sigma]Dyad[]*\[Tau]pDyad[] - \
